// .fxshow — sweep through every entry in the EFFECTS enum (scripts/include/client.inc)
// and let the GM drop one item per FX at a targeted tile, then auto-advance.
//
// Usage:
//   .fxshow             start at the first FX
//   .fxshow 0x1159      resume at the entry whose graphic is 0x1159
//   .fxshow ?           help
//
// Cancel the target prompt to stop. Resume with the hex printed at exit.

